[I] A utility to report core memory usage per program

[T] ps_mem is a Python utility that accurately reports the core memory used
[T] by each program, summing the private and shared memory of all its
[T] processes. Shared memory is accounted proportionally, and swap usage can
[T] be shown as well.

[U] https://github.com/pixelb/ps_mem

[A] Ps_mem Authors
